{
  "note": "Where a module's Documents live on disk — the cross-language contract behind themed folders (docs/architecture/project-files.md § Thematic folders). Input: every file path relative to the module folder, and the registered kind folders. A Document is `<folders…>/<kind dir>/<id>.yml` (or `.yaml`): zero to three themed folders, then a kind folder holding files only. The id is the file name, unique per kind across the module; the themed path never enters it. Paths are sorted. Owned by: plugin DocumentLayoutConformanceTest + editor domain/documentLayout.test.ts. Variants (design variantes-modules): with `variants.yml` (or `.yaml`) at the module root, `variants/<name>/…` is classified like a module path under the variant `<name>` and reported in `variants` (ids unique per kind inside a variant; absent key = no variant); without that file `variants/` is an ordinary themed folder.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "root kind folders, as before folders existed",
      "kindDirs": ["menus", "commands", "dialogs"],
      "paths": ["manifest.yaml", "menus/main.yaml", "commands/spawn.yaml", "dialogs/rules.yaml"],
      "documents": [
        { "path": "commands/spawn.yaml", "dir": "commands", "id": "spawn", "folder": "" },
        { "path": "dialogs/rules.yaml", "dir": "dialogs", "id": "rules", "folder": "" },
        { "path": "menus/main.yaml", "dir": "menus", "id": "main", "folder": "" }
      ],
      "errors": []
    },
    {
      "name": "themed folders mix kinds, nested up to three levels",
      "kindDirs": ["menus", "commands", "dialogs"],
      "paths": [
        "boutique/menus/shop.yaml",
        "boutique/commands/shop.yaml",
        "boutique/dialogs/welcome.yaml",
        "boutique/armes/menus/swords.yaml",
        "a/b/c/menus/deep.yaml"
      ],
      "documents": [
        { "path": "a/b/c/menus/deep.yaml", "dir": "menus", "id": "deep", "folder": "a/b/c" },
        { "path": "boutique/armes/menus/swords.yaml", "dir": "menus", "id": "swords", "folder": "boutique/armes" },
        { "path": "boutique/commands/shop.yaml", "dir": "commands", "id": "shop", "folder": "boutique" },
        { "path": "boutique/dialogs/welcome.yaml", "dir": "dialogs", "id": "welcome", "folder": "boutique" },
        { "path": "boutique/menus/shop.yaml", "dir": "menus", "id": "shop", "folder": "boutique" }
      ],
      "errors": []
    },
    {
      "name": "a module kind folder is read like a core one",
      "kindDirs": ["menus", "quest_groups"],
      "paths": ["quetes/quest_groups/daily.yaml", "quetes/menus/daily_quests.yaml"],
      "documents": [
        { "path": "quetes/menus/daily_quests.yaml", "dir": "menus", "id": "daily_quests", "folder": "quetes" },
        { "path": "quetes/quest_groups/daily.yaml", "dir": "quest_groups", "id": "daily", "folder": "quetes" }
      ],
      "errors": []
    },
    {
      "name": "an unregistered kind folder is nobody's Document",
      "kindDirs": ["menus"],
      "paths": ["quetes/quest_groups/daily.yaml", "quest_groups/weekly.yaml"],
      "documents": [],
      "errors": []
    },
    {
      "name": "resources, metadata, root files and loose files are not Documents",
      "kindDirs": ["menus"],
      "paths": [
        "manifest.yaml",
        "lang/fr.yaml",
        "items/sword.yml",
        "data/menus/row1.yaml",
        "models/menus/x.yaml",
